  "sections": [
    {
      "html": "<p>&gt; the primary frame of the drone was designed and iteratively refined using topology optimization to minimize mass while preserving stiffness and load paths.</p><p>&gt; the optimization cycles consisted of \"old frame &gt; topology study &gt; design new frame based off of the study.\"</p>",
