    {
      "html": "<p>&gt; Propeller blades design were based off a design researched by MIT, optimized for low noise.</p><p>&gt; Thrust was validated through CFD analysis in ANSYS Fluent to ensure required lift margins.</p><p>&gt; studies showed blades could maintain ~4N of thrust.</p>",
